Removed proprietary components
------------------------------

The upstream repository contains components licensed under the Activepieces
Enterprise license rather than MIT:

  - packages/ee/
  - packages/server/api/src/app/ee/

These directories and the code they contained have been REMOVED from this fork
in its first commit and must never be reintroduced. CI enforces that no code
imports from an `ee/` path. Only the MIT-licensed community core is used,
modified, and distributed here.

All Tyrbo modifications are tagged with `TYRBO-PATCH` comments and tracked in
FORK.md. Tyrbo modifications are licensed under the MIT license.
